<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Despite multiple collection letters between <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">date of first letter</span> and <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">date of most recent letter</span>,
you have failed to pay the total amount due to University Housing by <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">due date from most recent letter</span>.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Consequently, your license agreement has been
cancelled.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>You MUST vacate <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">address</span> by <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">date at 12:00 p.m</span>.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">In accordance with the terms of your License Agreement,
further charges will be assessed to your account if all personal items are not
removed from the interior and exterior of the residence and the keys returned
to the Housing office in Quad 2.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>You may
schedule a joint walk-through inspection to assess property condition and
potential charges for damage to the property.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;
</span>If you don’t schedule a joint inspection, one will be completed without
you and appropriate charges will be added to your account.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">After <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">12:00
p.m. on date</span>, access to the campus address will be restricted.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Should you fail to vacate the campus address,
ASU Police Department will be called for assistance to escort you from campus.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Please contact University Housing at 480-965-3433 with any
questions or concerns.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Thank you,</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

